  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing Durable Solutions to Internal Displacement in Vanuatu</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Co-implemented by IOM and UNDP in close partnership with the Government of Vanuatu, this project will address displacement needs that arise in the context of disasters and climate change, integrating development principles into the humanitarian response while enhancing the Government&#x2019;s capacity to address displacement risks and identify durable solutions.</narrative>
  </description>
